  description: A basilisk is a large hybrid reptile, heavy-bodied with a powerful
    tail, resembling a dragonkin. Despite its bulk, it moves fast, darting forward
    with sudden, predatory lunges. It makes only animalistic noises - hisses, rattling
    breaths, and deep reptilian growls, though its stare often feels deliberate and
    calculating.
